  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flyer One Ventures Fund V</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An equity investment of up to EUR 10 million in the Fund comprising (i) an  initial commitment of up to EUR 6.5 million, and (ii) an additional amount of  up to EUR 3.5 million which may be committed at any time prior to the final  closing of the Fund (expected to be within 24 months after launch) at the  discretion of Management.  The project will form part of the Bank&apos;s Early-Stage Innovation Facility II  (&quot;ESIF II&quot;), a EUR 200 million facility through which the EBRD selectively  invests in commercially oriented early-stage venture capital funds.  The Fund will make equity and equity-related investments in early-stage  technology driven companies with primary operations in Ukraine, Central and  Southeastern Europe and the Caucasus (collectively, the &quot;Target Region&quot;).  Null Value</narrative>
  </description>
